  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">東京証券取引所（プライム市場）</jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">単元株式数は100株であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:DetailsOfEmployeeShareOptionProgramTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head4"&gt;① 【ストックオプション制度の内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:center;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_center" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:453.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
